# Keyed-run template for the testnet relayer's own key (`scripts/relayer.ts address|once`), and the one
# `op-remote create` that makes Keyed-Runs/Unleashed-Testnet-Relayer (an item is created once, whole).
# The Worker reads the same value as its dashboard secret RELAYER_PRIVATE_KEY; TESTNET_FILLER must name
# its address. A small float only: about 0.02 ETH and 20 USDC on Sepolia.
# op: generate eth-key
RELAYER_PRIVATE_KEY=op://Keyed-Runs/Unleashed-Testnet-Relayer/RELAYER_PRIVATE_KEY
